  "description": "A powerful Aspect-Oriented Programming (AOP) library for .NET that provides transparent logging of method calls using dynamic proxies with distributed tracing. Supports async methods, parent/child span correlation, OpenTelemetry compatibility, custom formatting, configurable log levels, and HTTP middleware logging.",
  "id": "Mariodbx.AspectLogging",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2025-12-01T14:09:24.243Z",
